  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARSA. Capacity-building program for reintegration and social protection II. 2022-2023.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to expand the services offered to returnees through PARSA&apos;s Transition to Community Program, creating a network of support for sustainable reintegration. This among other things includes building a capacity program that will support the reintegration process. Additionally, the objective is to implement and manage the establishment of a model Trade Afghan Economic Center at the Kabul Marastoon to serve as a training center for ARCS program staff to initiate the replication of Trade Afghan economic centers in the other four Marastoons.</narrative>
  </description>
